BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-0@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270106T124000Z
DTEND:20270106T154000Z
SUMMARY:Arrive at Pearson Terminal 3
DESCRIPTION:Arrive 3 hours early for international flights. Partner: bring 
 Chinese passport\, US visa (confirm it's multiple-entry\, M) and PR card.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-1@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270106T154000Z
DTEND:20270106T212400Z
SUMMARY:Porter PD 783 departs
DESCRIPTION:About 5h 44m. Costa Rica is 1 hour behind Toronto.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-2@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270106T212400Z
DTEND:20270106T221500Z
SUMMARY:Land in Liberia
DESCRIPTION:Get the entry stamp (check it's in your passport)\, collect bag
 s\, then head to the Adobe shuttle stop.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.googl
 e.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Daniel%20Oduber%20Quir%C3%B3s%20Internation
 al%20Airport
LOCATION:Daniel Oduber Quirós International Airport
GEO:10.5917;-85.5411
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Daniel Od
 uber Quirós International Airport":geo:10.5917,-85.5411
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-3@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270106T221500Z
DTEND:20270106T230000Z
SUMMARY:Pick up the car
DESCRIPTION:Bring your physical licence\, passport\, and a credit card in t
 he driver's name (deposit ~USD1\,000). Inspect the car and take photos\; c
 heck by hand that the doors are locked\, as rental car break-ins are commo
 n here.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-4@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270106T230000Z
DTEND:20270106T233000Z
SUMMARY:Check in at Playas del Coco
DESCRIPTION:About 30 min\, arrive before dark.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.
 google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Villa%20Del%20Sol%20Boutique%20Hotel%2
 C%20Playas%20del%20Coco
LOCATION:Villa Del Sol Boutique Hotel\, Playas del Coco
GEO:10.55894;-85.690166
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Villa Del
  Sol Boutique Hotel, Playas del Coco":geo:10.55894,-85.690166
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-5@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270106T233000Z
DTEND:20270107T010000Z
SUMMARY:Sunset on the beach
DESCRIPTION:The beach in front of the hotel faces west\, so the sun sets ri
 ght over the water.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?ap
 i=1&query=Playas%20del%20Coco%20Beach%2C%20Guanacaste
LOCATION:Playas del Coco Beach\, Guanacaste
GEO:10.5585;-85.6915
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Playas de
 l Coco Beach, Guanacaste":geo:10.5585,-85.6915
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-6@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270107T010000Z
DTEND:20270107T020000Z
SUMMARY:Seafood by the sea
DESCRIPTION:Walk into Coco town (about 15 minutes): Papagayo Seafood (often
  live music) or Mar Azul\; take a taxi back if you don’t feel like walki
 ng.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Playas
 %20del%20Coco%2C%20Guanacaste%2C%20Costa%20Rica
LOCATION:Playas del Coco\, Guanacaste\, Costa Rica
GEO:10.5505;-85.6995
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Playas de
 l Coco, Guanacaste, Costa Rica":geo:10.5505,-85.6995
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-7@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270107T020000Z
DTEND:20270107T030000Z
SUMMARY:Stargazing on the beach
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow\, 1/7\, is the new moon\, so tonight is nearly moonles
 s\; Guanacaste’s dry season is mostly clear and it is fully dark by 19:0
 0. The darker north end of Coco beach is right in front of the hotel\; wal
 k away from the streetlights\, lie on a towel and look: Orion is high in t
 he southeast with Sirius\, the brightest star\, below it\; after 21:00 loo
 k low in the south for Canopus (the second-brightest star\, never visible 
 from Toronto). Use Stellarium or SkyView on your phone to identify stars. 
 Bring only your phone and a towel\, no valuables\, and don’t wander far\
 ; tomorrow is an early start on mountain roads\, so don’t stay up too la
 te.\n\nMoon phases (timeanddate): https://www.timeanddate.com/moon/phases/
 costa-rica/liberia?year=2027\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/sea
 rch/?api=1&query=Playas%20del%20Coco%20Beach%2C%20Guanacaste
LOCATION:Playas del Coco Beach\, Guanacaste
GEO:10.5585;-85.6915
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Playas de
 l Coco Beach, Guanacaste":geo:10.5585,-85.6915
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-0@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270107T130000Z
DTEND:20270107T142000Z
SUMMARY:Check out and set off
DESCRIPTION:Bring some cash (the waterfall is cash only). South via Liberia
  and Bagaces\, about 1 h 15 min to the waterfall.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-1@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270107T142000Z
DTEND:20270107T152000Z
SUMMARY:Llanos de Cortés waterfall
DESCRIPTION:About 30 concrete steps with a rope handrail\; sandy at the bot
 tom\, rocky at the edge and in the water. You can take a dip\; watch your 
 step on the rocks so you don't roll an ankle.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.
 google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Llanos%20de%20Cort%C3%A9s%20Waterfall%
 2C%20Bagaces
LOCATION:Llanos de Cortés Waterfall\, Bagaces
GEO:10.524302;-85.298602
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Llanos de
  Cortés Waterfall, Bagaces":geo:10.524302,-85.298602
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-2@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270107T152000Z
DTEND:20270107T190000Z
SUMMARY:Route 1 to Monteverde
DESCRIPTION:Via Cañas\, turning onto Route 606 for the climb\, about 2.5 h
 ours\; Route 606 is paved but steep with tight bends\, so take it slowly. 
 Reach Santa Elena around 12:00 for a quick lunch.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-3@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270107T190000Z
DTEND:20270107T220000Z
SUMMARY:100% Aventura ziplines
DESCRIPTION:About 2.5–3 hours: 10 ziplines\, the longest 1\,590 m\, the l
 ongest in Costa Rica\; the last two are Superman lines you fly face-down\,
  plus one Tarzan swing (optional). From USD72 per person on the official s
 ite (plus tax)\, transport not included\; about 10 minutes’ drive from t
 own. Check the booking page for slots (commonly 8:00\, 11:00\, 13:00\, 15:
 00). Her Achilles is still in rehab: on the Superman lines staff brake you
  and help you stand\, so the stop itself is gentle\; what to watch is the 
 stairs and forest paths between platforms\, and the occasional foot touchd
 own at the end of the regular lines\, so ask her physio before booking.\n\
 nBook 100% Aventura (official): https://fareharbor.com/embeds/book/aventur
 acanopytour/items/39178/calendar/?ref=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aventuracanopytour
 .com&language=en-us\n100% Aventura official site: https://www.aventuracano
 pytour.com/\nAlternative: Selvatura ziplines (also has a Superman line): h
 ttps://selvatura.com/packages/\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/s
 earch/?api=1&query=100%25%20Aventura%20Zipline%2C%20Monteverde
LOCATION:100% Aventura Zipline\, Monteverde
GEO:10.3388806;-84.8241529
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="100% Aven
 tura Zipline, Monteverde":geo:10.3388806,-84.8241529
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-4@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270107T220000Z
DTEND:20270107T233000Z
SUMMARY:Check in to the Monteverde hotel
DESCRIPTION:0.8 km from the town centre\; rest a bit and grab a jacket: Mon
 teverde evenings are only in the teens and often windy with drizzle.\n\nGo
 ogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hotel%20Monta%C
 3%B1a%20Monteverde
LOCATION:Hotel Montaña Monteverde
GEO:10.3115843;-84.816105
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Hotel Mon
 taña Monteverde":geo:10.3115843,-84.816105
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-5@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270107T233000Z
DTEND:20270108T013000Z
SUMMARY:Rainforest night walk
DESCRIPTION:At Bajo del Tigre (Children’s Eternal Rainforest) a guide lea
 ds you by flashlight to find tree frogs\, snakes\, spiders and sleeping bi
 rds\, and with luck sloths and agoutis. USD30 + tax per person\, minimum 2
 \; about 5 minutes’ drive from the hotel. The trails are forest dirt pat
 hs\, so wear closed non-slip shoes and bring a rain jacket and bug spray.\
 n\nBajo del Tigre rates and booking: https://acmcr.org/en/rates-and-reserv
 ations/\nAlternative: Monteverde Cloud Forest Reserve night walk: https://
 mytanfeet.com/booking/monteverde-cloud-forest-reserve-night-walk/\nGoogle 
 Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bajo%20del%20Tigre%2
 C%20Bosque%20Eterno%20de%20los%20Ni%C3%B1os%2C%20Monteverde
LOCATION:Bajo del Tigre\, Bosque Eterno de los Niños\, Monteverde
GEO:10.3056389;-84.8144494
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Bajo del 
 Tigre, Bosque Eterno de los Niños, Monteverde":geo:10.3056389,-84.8144494
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-6@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270108T014500Z
DTEND:20270108T024500Z
SUMMARY:Dinner in town
DESCRIPTION:Eat in Santa Elena town\, then drive a few minutes back to the 
 hotel.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d3-0@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270108T130000Z
DTEND:20270108T143000Z
SUMMARY:Breakfast
DESCRIPTION:Breakfast is included at the hotel\; mornings in the mountains 
 are the clearest\, with cloud rising out of the valleys.\n\nGoogle Maps: h
 ttps://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hotel%20Monta%C3%B1a%20Mont
 everde
LOCATION:Hotel Montaña Monteverde
GEO:10.3115843;-84.816105
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Hotel Mon
 taña Monteverde":geo:10.3115843,-84.816105
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d3-1@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270108T143000Z
DTEND:20270108T173000Z
SUMMARY:Down to La Fortuna
DESCRIPTION:Down Route 606\, via Cañas and Tilarán\, then along the north
  shore of Lake Arenal\; all paved\, about 4 hours of driving. Skip the dir
 t shortcut from Monteverde to Tilarán.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d3-2@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270108T173000Z
DTEND:20270108T193000Z
SUMMARY:North shore of Lake Arenal
DESCRIPTION:Follow the winding Route 142 and stop at roadside viewpoints fo
 r photos of the lake and volcano\; lunch in Nuevo Arenal.\n\nGoogle Maps: 
 https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nuevo%20Arenal%2C%20Guanac
 aste%2C%20Costa%20Rica
LOCATION:Nuevo Arenal\, Guanacaste\, Costa Rica
GEO:10.547;-84.863736
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Nuevo Are
 nal, Guanacaste, Costa Rica":geo:10.547,-84.863736
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d3-3@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270108T193000Z
DTEND:20270108T210000Z
SUMMARY:Check in at Termales del Arenal
DESCRIPTION:All the driving done in daylight. Once the room is ready\, star
 t with the hotel hot spring pools.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/
 maps/search/?api=1&query=Termales%20del%20Arenal%2C%20La%20Fortuna
LOCATION:Termales del Arenal\, La Fortuna
GEO:10.478292;-84.672823
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Termales 
 del Arenal, La Fortuna":geo:10.478292,-84.672823
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d3-4@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270108T210000Z
DTEND:20270109T003000Z
SUMMARY:Soak in the hotel hot springs
DESCRIPTION:Soak for a while\, then head into town for dinner in the evenin
 g.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Termale
 s%20del%20Arenal%2C%20La%20Fortuna
LOCATION:Termales del Arenal\, La Fortuna
GEO:10.478292;-84.672823
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Termales 
 del Arenal, La Fortuna":geo:10.478292,-84.672823
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d3-5@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270109T003000Z
DTEND:20270109T013000Z
SUMMARY:Dinner in town
DESCRIPTION:Snapper's House is right in the town centre\; drive 5 minutes b
 ack to the hotel afterwards.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/s
 earch/?api=1&query=La%20Fortuna%2C%20San%20Carlos%2C%20Costa%20Rica
LOCATION:La Fortuna\, San Carlos\, Costa Rica
GEO:10.471683;-84.644436
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="La Fortun
 a, San Carlos, Costa Rica":geo:10.471683,-84.644436
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d4-0@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270109T120000Z
DTEND:20270109T133000Z
SUMMARY:Early volcano viewing
DESCRIPTION:The volcano is most likely to show itself 6–9 am\, and you ca
 n see it from the hotel.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d4-1@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270109T133000Z
DTEND:20270109T180000Z
SUMMARY:Peñas Blancas safari float
DESCRIPTION:Hotel pickup\; you sit in an inflatable raft steered by the gui
 de\, with little or no paddling (some operators ask for a few light stroke
 s)\, for about 2 hours spotting sloths\, monkeys\, caimans and birds\; bac
 k around 11:00. You get on and off at the riverbank\, which may be muddy a
 nd rocky\, so watch your step and wear non-slip\, closed-toe water shoes.\
 n\nFortuna Welcome safari float · USD70 with transfers · leaves 7:30\, a
 bout 4 hours: https://www.fortunawelcome.com/la-fortuna-tours/safari-float
 -penas-blancas-river/\nAlternative: Desafío safari float · USD72 + tax w
 ith transfers · starts 8:00\, about 3 hours\, some light paddling: https:
 //www.desafiocostarica.com/service/safari-float-penas-blancas/\nAlternativ
 e: Two Weeks in Costa Rica safari float · USD69 + tax from January\, with
  transfers · leaves 7:30\, about 4.5 hours: https://www.twoweeksincostari
 ca.com/product/safari-float-penas-blancas-river-group-tour/\nGoogle Maps: 
 https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pe%C3%B1as%20Blancas%20Riv
 er%2C%20San%20Carlos%2C%20Costa%20Rica
LOCATION:Peñas Blancas River\, San Carlos\, Costa Rica
GEO:10.39;-84.58
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Peñas Bl
 ancas River, San Carlos, Costa Rica":geo:10.39,-84.58
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d4-2@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270109T180000Z
DTEND:20270109T200000Z
SUMMARY:Lunch in town
DESCRIPTION:Ceviche at Cevichería D'Mora.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.goog
 le.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=La%20Fortuna%2C%20San%20Carlos%2C%20Costa%
 20Rica
LOCATION:La Fortuna\, San Carlos\, Costa Rica
GEO:10.471683;-84.644436
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="La Fortun
 a, San Carlos, Costa Rica":geo:10.471683,-84.644436
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d4-3@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270109T200000Z
DTEND:20270109T223000Z
SUMMARY:Mistico Hanging Bridges Park
DESCRIPTION:About 25 min drive. 3.2 km loop with gentle slopes and steps\; 
 the hanging bridges sway\; ~2 hours. Tag along behind a guided group and y
 ou'll often spot small creatures like eyelash vipers. Watch your footing o
 n the slopes. Last entry 15:50.\n\nMistico official site: https://misticop
 ark.com/\nAlternative: Mistico guided natural history walk · USD44 + tax 
 · about 2.5 hours\, a guide spots wildlife for you: https://misticopark.c
 om/tours/natural-history-walk/\nAlternative: Fortuna Welcome hanging bridg
 es tour · USD70 with transfers and entry · leaves 14:00\, about 4 hours:
  https://www.fortunawelcome.com/la-fortuna-tours/arenal-hanging-bridges-to
 ur/\nAlternative: Sky Adventures hanging bridges (El Castillo\, about 40 m
 inutes by car) · booking required: https://skyadventures.travel/hanging-b
 ridges/\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mist
 ico%20Arenal%20Hanging%20Bridges%20Park
LOCATION:Mistico Arenal Hanging Bridges Park
GEO:10.488049;-84.753777
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Mistico A
 renal Hanging Bridges Park":geo:10.488049,-84.753777
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d4-4@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270109T223000Z
DTEND:20270110T003000Z
SUMMARY:Back to the hotel for the hot springs
DESCRIPTION:After the bridges\, soak for a while before heading out to dinn
 er.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Termal
 es%20del%20Arenal%2C%20La%20Fortuna
LOCATION:Termales del Arenal\, La Fortuna
GEO:10.478292;-84.672823
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Termales 
 del Arenal, La Fortuna":geo:10.478292,-84.672823
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d4-5@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270110T003000Z
DTEND:20270110T013000Z
SUMMARY:Dinner in town
DESCRIPTION:5 min drive to town: Snapper's House (marlin ceviche\, seafood 
 soup) or Cevichería D'Mora\; drive back to the hotel afterwards.\n\nGoogl
 e Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=La%20Fortuna%2C%20
 San%20Carlos%2C%20Costa%20Rica
LOCATION:La Fortuna\, San Carlos\, Costa Rica
GEO:10.471683;-84.644436
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="La Fortun
 a, San Carlos, Costa Rica":geo:10.471683,-84.644436
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d5-0@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270110T133000Z
DTEND:20270110T140000Z
SUMMARY:Hotel pickup (horseback tour)
DESCRIPTION:The volcano is most likely to be visible in the morning.\n\nGoo
 gle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Termales%20del%2
 0Arenal%2C%20La%20Fortuna
LOCATION:Termales del Arenal\, La Fortuna
GEO:10.478292;-84.672823
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Termales 
 del Arenal, La Fortuna":geo:10.478292,-84.672823
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d5-1@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270110T140000Z
DTEND:20270110T170000Z
SUMMARY:Horseback ride with Arenal Volcano views
DESCRIPTION:About 2.5 hours of riding through forest and pasture to a volca
 no viewpoint and Los Lirios lake\; the guide gives a lesson first. Note: k
 eeping heels down in the stirrups and pushing off one foot to mount and di
 smount put some strain on the Achilles\; if it feels tight\, keep the hors
 e at a walk.\n\nFortuna Welcome horseback tour: https://www.fortunawelcome
 .com/la-fortuna-tours/arenal-volcano-horseback-riding-tour\nAlternative: M
 istico Paco’s Horses ride · USD58 + tax · starts 8:15\, about 2.5 hour
 s\, crosses a river on horseback: https://misticopark.com/tours/pacos-hors
 es/\nAlternative: Don Tobias ride to a volcano lookout · starts 8:30\, ab
 out 3 hours\, transfers included\, ask for the price: https://www.arenal.n
 et/tours/don-tobias-horseback-ride-volcano
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d5-2@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T191351Z
DTSTART:20270110T173000Z
DTEND:20270110T190000Z
SUMMARY:Back to the hotel to change and have lunch
DESCRIPTION:A simple lunch at the hotel or in town\; the sloth tour picks y
